  "description": "<p>Related to <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1338\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1338</a> and <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1351\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1351</a></p>\n\n<p>The maven configuration should be updated to include recent updates from dependencies, and generally should be cleaned up. For instance, there is no reason to use &lt;pluginManagement&gt; if there are no downstream modules inheriting the maven configuration. Plus, it would be good to put all of the maven plugin version numbers in variables near the top of the pom.xml file</p>",
